# WHAT TO HOLD FOR WHAT THE GOAL WANTS (Survival.describe_target, Guide.goal_wants):
# the pinned goal is beds at a holding, a lean-to wants a rag, and with the pick
# in hand the wreckage in reach breaks for plate. The prompt under it says what to
# hold for the rag; with the knife in hand it gathers the rag and says no more.
#
#   TOUR_TIMEOUT=600 tools/tour.sh tours/tool-hint.tour --seed=1 --hour=9 --weather=clear:0 --beats=marens_lead --give=pick:1,iron_ore:1,kit_plate:1
#
# Oyster Row sees him at the spawn; paid by the crew and away at their camp, the
# small hours take one of its people, and the holding is wanted.
coast calm
wait 1.0
at cast:rook
await cast:rook 8
wait 0.6
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
tap move_down
tap move_down
wait 0.3
press use
wait 0.5
press use
wait 0.8
hour 5 +1
await taken 10
# The night has left him hungry, which outranks every other want: fed first.
try 10
  near bush
  walk 0,0 0.05
  press use 0.1
  await took:berries 8
  tap inventory
  wait 0.5
  choose berries
  tap use
  wait 0.4
  tap inventory
  wait 1.0
  await goal:holding 2
end
try 3
  near bush
  walk 0,0 0.05
  press use 0.1
  await took:berries 8
  tap inventory
  wait 0.5
  choose berries
  tap use
  wait 0.4
  tap inventory
  wait 1.0
end
try 3
  near bush
  walk 0,0 0.05
  press use 0.1
  await took:berries 8
  tap inventory
  wait 0.5
  choose berries
  tap use
  wait 0.4
  tap inventory
  wait 1.0
end
village 0
wait 1.0
tap inventory
wait 0.5
choose pick
tap use
wait 0.3
tap inventory
wait 0.4
near wreckage
wait 0.8
shot 01-the-pick-in-hand-says-what-to-hold with goal:holding
tap inventory
wait 0.5
choose knife
tap use
wait 0.3
tap inventory
wait 0.4
near wreckage
wait 0.8
shot 02-the-knife-in-hand-gathers-the-rag with goal:holding
